| `inventory.py` | `reserve()` used `>=` instead of `>`, rejecting exact-available reservations | Changed `>=` → `>` so reserving up to full available succeeds |
| `text_utils.py` | `slugify` didn't lowercase characters | Added `.lower()` when appending alphanumeric chars |
| `text_utils.py` | `slugify`'s `replace("--","-")` didn't collapse 3+ consecutive dashes | Loop `replace("--","-")` until no more double-dashes remain |
| `text_utils.py` | `truncate` didn't account for suffix length in max_len | Changed `text[:max_len]` → `text[:max_len - len(suffix)]` |
